== Description ==

The '''Anvil''' forges metal weapons, armor, tools, and mechanical parts from smelted ingots. It defines 42 raw recipe entries (42 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Blade Baseball Bat]], [[Combat Knife]], [[Copper Wire]], [[Crude Axe]], [[Curved Handle Iron Axe]], [[Fruit Knife]], [[Gear]], [[Hunting Knife]], plus 34 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.AnvilWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Anvil</code>.

